    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4312" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλῑτρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλιτηρός</span>
			, <i>sinful, wicked</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.361
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				377
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				13.27
			</span></i>; also in late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPar.</u>
				63.95
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>: neut. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλιτρά, τά</span>, <i>sins</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.59
			</span></i>: as Subst.,<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίμοσιν
