			</span></i>, etc.; <i>knave</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.182
			</span></i>; fem., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλιτρῆς ἀλώπεκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Semon.
					7.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
